1200 GOSUB 6360:BM$="Vince: There's been no changes in Susanna's behavior during her stay in\Rome. They should be leaving for Germany after tonight's concert.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Clark: You read the papers this morning? I could hardly believe it myself...\Damiel Horkai, the owner of that house with the crest, was found\murdered.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1220 GOSUB 6360:BM$="Vince: Yeah. It appears he was murdered around midnight. We were outside\the restaurant the whole time, so we know Susanna had nothing to do with\it.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1230 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Clark: David searches for the crest, a fortune teller points the way, he\finds Horkai and BAM, he ends up dead. I don't think it's a coincidence.\We're talking about an Earl here, one with a close connection to the Pope.":GOSUB 5100:BM$="This ain't your run-of-the-mill murder.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
