1250 COMMON FO:GOSUB 6110:BM$="After the sun went down, Eleno Vision was ready to begin their last\concert in Rome.":GOSUB 5100
1260 GOSUB 9555:BM$="Just like the previous time, David's energy fueled the crowd's excitement.\The new sorting of the songs had the desired effect; while some of the\audience collapsed from anemia, generally speaking the concert ended":GOSUB 5100:BM$="without issues.":GOSUB 5100
